PI</strong><p>Un recorrido paso a paso para conocer rutas, solicitudes y respuestas en una aplicación web.</p><span class="tutorial-link">Abrir guía oficial ↗</span></a><a class="tutorial-card" href="https://react.dev/learn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="tutorial-index">03 / REACT</span><strong>Componentes e interfaces</strong><p>Conceptos para construir interfaces, mostrar datos y responder a interacciones con React.</p><span class="tutorial-link">Abrir guía oficial ↗</span></a><a class="tutorial-card" href="https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/tutorial" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="tutorial-index">04 / KOTLIN</span><strong>Una interfaz con Compose</strong><p>Un tutorial para practicar funciones composables, layouts y estilos en una pantalla Android.</p><span class="tutorial-link">Abrir guía oficial ↗</span></a></div></section><section class="social-presence"><div class="blog-section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow-label">SIGAMOS EN CONTACTO</span><h2>Presencia profesional y social</h2></div></div><div class="presence-grid"><a href="https://github.com/JonnySDE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="presence-icon github-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 .8a11.2 11.2 0 0 0-3.54 21.83c.56.1.76-.24.76-.54v-2.1c-3.1.68-3.75-1.32-3.75-1.32-.51-1.29-1.25-1.63-1.25-1.63-1.02-.7.08-.69.08-.69 1.13.08 1.72 1.16 1.72 1.16 1 1.72 2.62 1.22 3.26.93.1-.73.39-1.23.71-1.51-2.48-.28-5.09-1.24-5.09-5.52 0-1.22.43-2.21 1.16-2.99-.12-.28-.5-1.42.11-2.96 0 0 .95-.3 3.08 1.14a10.7 10.7 0 0 1 5.6 0c2.13-1.44 3.08-1.14 3.08-1.14.61 1.54.23 2.68.11 2.96.72.78 1.16 1.77 1.16 2.99 0 4.29-2.62 5.23-5.11 5.51.4.35.76 1.03.76 2.08v3.09c0 .3.2.65.77.54A11.2 11.2 0 0 0 12 .8Z"/></svg></span><span><strong>GitHub</strong><small>Repositorios y proyectos</small></span><b>↗</b></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jonathan-rodr%C3%ADguez-cabrera-ba8486435/?utm_source=share_via&amp;utm_c